                    is              he        going to    arrive?</span> ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Where are you going to be next?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What are you going to do for the rest of the day?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Are you going to come with me?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Mayan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "from the ancient Mayan civilization in Mexico ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We went to the Mayan temple.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about sightseeing.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to climb", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go up", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to climb the hill.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "day off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a day with no work ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Monday is my day off from work this week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "the rest of the day", "type": "name"}, {"content": "from this point in the day until the end", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am going to do nothing for the rest of the day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "floating", "type": "name"}, {"content": "moving on the surface of a liquid ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Amsterdam has a floating market.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think about what you can do on the weekend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 sentences about your ideas or intentions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's intentions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about social plans.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express intention.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I communicate my plans to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to my partner's plans.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le10ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le10ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "50", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: How is Amsterdam? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's fun. I went on the ghost tour in the old city. This morning I explored the flower market."}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "10000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: What's it like?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's called a floating market, but it's not. There are houseboats on the water near the market."}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "19000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: What are you going to do for the rest of the day?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I could rent a bike but it's raining right now."}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "27000", "text": "<